[statement]
A condition's `!` entry on a name the package provides at no version holds
while no other package of that name is installed: `b` provides `x` at no
version, its condition is `!x` and `e`, and apk installs `b` with `e`
(`a-condition-forbidding-a-name-the-package-provides-at-a-version-never-holds`).

[repository]
P:b
V:1
i:!x e
p:x

P:e
V:1

[request]
e

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install e 1
install b 1
